   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender training follow-up</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender training follow-up</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet skall utbilda givarpartners i j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och gender mainstreaming fokus Moldova. S&#xe4;rskilt inbjudna &#xe4;r nya EU  medlemsl&#xe4;nder. utbildningen genomf&#xf6;rs av konsult fr&#xe5;n UK, p&#xe5; rekommendation av DFID. Projetket sker inom ramen f&#xf6;r Sverige som lead donor i j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at training donor partners in gender equality and gender mainstreaming focusing Moldova. partuclarly invited are new EU member states. The traning is conducted by a consultant from the UK, on recommendations by DFID. Project is part of program where Sweden is lead donor for GE in Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
